          <p class="text-lg text-center">
          This page provides audio examples corresponding to the experiments described in our paper "MagTapeDB: A Dataset of Historical Magnetic Tape Recordings" You will find pairs of degraded and restored audio excerpts for both piano and bandoneon, including noise types such as analog tape hiss and gramophone surface noise. The examples are intended to complement the objective evaluation with perceptual insight into the restoration quality.
